      "label": "common_0320_rival_06",
      "hash64": "BA413FDC052E8FC8",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)][VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳一定能打贏的！\\n加油！我會再聯絡的～！[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
