    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_0320_friend_04",
      "hash64": "BC71CA5D2B33E280",
      "text": "從那裡的話，距離聽說能遇上\\n岩壁寶主的岩石地帶蠻近的。[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_0320_friend_05",
      "hash64": "BC71CB5D2B33E433",
      "text": "那傢伙似乎會像岩石一樣\\n緊貼在峭壁上，\\r\\n伺機捕捉獵物！[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
